# frontend/src/lib/decks — deck editor client logic

Pure TypeScript modules for the v2 deck editor (no React, no `window` globals).

## Key modules
- **drawHand.ts** — Draw Hand pile + random draw (8 cards, 9th on event). Spec: `docs/current/DRAW_HAND_FEATURE.md`.
- **deckCardCatalog.ts** — Catalog index for deck rows (`buildDeckCardIndex`, `resolveDeckCatalogCard`, `deckCardDisplayName`). Normalizes underscore deck types; id-only fallback.
- **simulateKo.ts** — Simulate KO dimming rules (`shouldDimDeckCard`, `buildKoDimmingContext`).
- **deckInstances.ts**, **reserveCharacter.ts**, **iconTotals.ts**, **deckThreat.ts** — editor save model, reserve, stats.

Legacy v1 equivalents live under `public/js/components/draw-hand.js` and `simulate-ko.js`.
